NOTE ON THE DATA

This licence covers the source code only.

The processing dates in `data/observations.json` and `public/data/timeline.json`
originate from the Immigration Service Delivery website and are the copyright of
the Department of Justice. They are re-used under the re-use terms published by
ISD ("You may re-use the information on this website free of charge in any
format") and the Regulations on the Re-use of Public Sector Information.

The derived figures — waits, trends, paces and estimates — are calculations made
by this project and are not official figures.
